      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow3:010",
        "answer": "Creates the selection instruction, specialist image and specialist name. Both character-dependent children subscribe to CharacterSelection.characterIndex and update only for nonnil model values. It registers close, conditionally calls PostLoadFunc and returns self. Character display lookup/rendering and the actual selection action remain external. Constructs CoD.NewSpecialistFooter from the displayed menu/controller/layout arguments. Creates SelForNewSpawn as LUI.UIText.new, SpecialistImage as LUI.UIFixedAspectRatioImage.new, SpecialistName as LUI.UIText.new. Connects 2 model/path references; the model subscription effects below specify which receiver changes and under which nil/value guard. Installs 1 event/action/override bindings; each callback keeps its captured controller/menu/widget references and executes only on its bound delivery. The ordered effect contract retains every proper [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
        "unknowns": [
          "Original source-to-PS4/VM/native/loader identity and bytecode fidelity are unverified.",
          "Effective settings, assets/tables/model schemas, server/service implementation and callback delivery/lifetime are unverified.",
          "Exact source request semantics do not prove rendering, networking, persistence, progression or game behavior.",
          "Public reuse is the frozen manager audit only; no worker web/repository discovery was performed."
        ],
